{"id":"nariz","lemma":"nariz","pos":"noun","rank":1088,"glosses":["nose (a protuberance on the face housing the nostrils, which are used to breathe or smell)","nose; smell (sense of smell)"],"ipa":"/naˈɾiθ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"narices"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-nariz.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me pica la nariz.","en":"My nose itches.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441138"},{"text":"Fue raro de narices.","en":"It was extremely weird.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460964"},{"text":"Me sangra la nariz.","en":"I have a nosebleed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450433"},{"text":"Estoy hasta las narices de hamburguesas.","en":"I'm sick and tired of hamburgers.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/353527"},{"text":"Le sangra la nariz.","en":"He has a nose bleed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524363"}]}